<title>INDIA: India ICICI sells Cheminor shrs.</title>
<headline>India ICICI sells Cheminor shrs.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Term-lending bank Industrial Credit and Investment Corp of India Ltd (ICICI) said on Saturday it sold 200,000 equity shares of Cheminor Drugs Ltd at 105.50 rupees per share.</p>
<p>The shares sold represented 1.46 percent of Cheminor's capital, ICICI said in a statement.</p>
<p>It did not say when the shares were sold.</p>
<p>Cheminor is a pharmaceutical manufacturer and exporter based in the southern city of Hyderabad.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
